# Phase 7 attack selector, read by edge-router and attacker.
#   none        clean encrypted operation (7.2 verify)
#   alter       (i)   alter the answer in transit  (corrupt the DoT stream)
#   rogue-cert  (ii)  impersonate the resolver with a rogue certificate
#   block       (iii) deny the encrypted transport to force cleartext fallback
ATTACK=none
